WEBVTT

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.760
Please take these too.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.610
Death is always close by.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.330
It's the end if the reaper has his eyes on you.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:35.010
It's starting!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
The Great Clash of the Magi: the Holy Grail War!

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:54.800
Wait...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.450
Why the heck am I Blackbeard?!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.450
I <i>am</i> the rules.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:05.410
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:22.810
Just a dream.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.410
You're finally awake, Lancer-kun.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:28.650
Who are you?

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.060
Does it matter who I am?

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.820
What do you want from me?

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:38.360
I just felt like saving you, so I came to give you a warning.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.650
Mind your own business.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:45.820
I don't need any warnings from an ugly mascot doll like you.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:46.910
Farewell.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:52.400
Hey, you've been having lots of dreams where you die, right?

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:58.280
Those are signs of upcoming deaths that really will happen.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.510
Let's see... I believe they're called prophetic dreams.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:02.980
Prophetic dreams?

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:05.270
You don't have to understand.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.860
Just feel.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.560
Don't screw with me!

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.490
You're the clown of this festival.

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:21.490
You really will be killed if you aren't careful.

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:23.240
By who?

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.240
By the story.

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:32.130
How lame.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:34.980
Hey.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.300
Shut up-

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.510
See?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.390
Watch out in tomorrow's race.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.640
Death will come right after you.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.810
Damn reaper.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.480
I do believe I'm your savior, though?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.250
It's finally here!

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.520
The 5th Holy Grail War!

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:04.910
We'll be bringing you this sonic-speed ground battle live from the Fuyuki City suburban special course.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:15.480
You just need to avoid each death and
find a way to escape your destiny of death.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.550
There's no way I'd die.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.280
The signal will change from red...

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.580
...to green!

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:22.760
And the competitors are off!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.760
Who just took the lead with such incredible speed?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.140
It's Lancer's Gae-BolCar!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.430
I'm settling this right here!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:32.810
The first turn.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.060
I can't slow down?!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.820
And I can't turn!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.200
Shit! What do I do?!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.330
I can't accept that.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.870
Like hell I'd die!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.830
They killed Lancer!

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.470
You bastards!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.980
Like hell I'd die.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:24.360
Can you avoid all the destined deaths sent your way?

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.200
It's eating something.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.160
Maybe it's hungry.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.540
Kings throughout the ages have always been hungry.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.290
Let's feed it Lancer.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.550
W-W-Wait-

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.350
Ow...

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.380
What the hell?

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.470
Th-This is...

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.580
Ooh, there there.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.120
There we go.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.350
Oh? What's going on here?

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:01.520
Looks like it recognizes him as a friend.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:11.620
Thank you so much!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.960
It's that!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.760
Watch out, Master!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.510
W-W-W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:05.890
Like hell I'd die!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:12.300
A large truck burst into flames in a series of car crashes on a highway.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.290
Fortunately, there were no casualties in this accident.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.530
As for the cause of the accident...

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.060
Good thing nobody was hurt.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.060
You okay, kid?

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.530
Don't run out like that again.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.450
Thank you, guy in blue body tights!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.370
Sure.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.240
Not bad at all, Lancer-kun.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.480
You've passed everything so far.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:54.810
Looks like you already know how to break free from this cycle of cursed destiny.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.490
You'll overcome every last death in the story.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:07.070
The 5th Great Clash of the Magi: the Holy Grail War!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.960
Good evening, ladies and gentlemen!

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:16.260
I'm your host, Ilyasviel von Einzbern!

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.870
I am Kotomine Kirei.

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:21.460
The 5th Holy Grail War has finally begun.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.040
That's right. I'll get my hands on the Grail.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.340
And then I'll end this ridiculous festival of death!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.220
Hey, wait a sec!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.010
Come on, Lancer-chan.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.670
It's just a game. You'll be fine.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:39.850
This is bad.

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.940
I <i>am</i> the rules.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.200
This is the final...

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.690
No, it's the first death!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.320
He escaped?!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.580
The winner... will be me!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:08.630
I had no idea the Holy Grail War was such a difficult battle...

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:15.510
Is that the... Holy Grail?!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.020
I'm not gonna die.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:23.770
Receive him.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.770
Wait for me!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.280
Let me take the rocket too!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.180
That's it.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.530
You really get it, Lancer-kun.

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:41.240
Your one-way ticket to a story where you can avoid death.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.660
That thing is...

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:43.850
I...

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:47.710
I definitely won't die!

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:49.430
That's right.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:54.880
Ironic and predictable it may be, but that thing is the Grail.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.930
Why?!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.100
Wh...

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:14.330
Where am I?!

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.830
A land where I can live in peace.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:26.580
I've bested my destiny of death.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.090
So I fell asleep.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:43.220
Ugh, it's so goddamn noisy!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.850
What's that sound?

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.560
That's-

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.110
We'd just fixed it, too!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.330
I'm not... a clown...

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.170
I already told you.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.620
Death is always close by.

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:17.440
You have to overcome every last death in the story.

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:38.820
Super teacher, Fujimura Taiga-san.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.530
Today, she once again spreads laughter and
warmth everywhere in Homurahara Academy.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.760
The students are all smiles from Fujimura-sensei's heavenly beauty.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.480
That was showbiz news.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.110
Da hell's this?

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.270
My PV!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.540
Next episode: Badump Date Super Plan - Answer.

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.710
Look forward to it!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.470
That was showbiz news.
